---
// Sits above the header so it's the very first thing a visitor reads —
// the disclosure in SiteFooter.astro repeats it, but nobody should have
// to scroll to the bottom of the page to learn this isn't the real site.
---

<div class="redesign-notice">
  <p>
    Unofficial, unsolicited redesign of melonDS — the real project lives at
    <a href="https://melonds.kuribo64.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >melonds.kuribo64.net</a
    >.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .redesign-notice {
    background: var(--panel);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }

  .redesign-notice p {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0.6rem var(--gutter);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .redesign-notice a {
    color: var(--glow);
  }
</style>
